# Deployment

## Environments

[% for (stageObj in awsRoot.stages.sortBy(stageObj | stageObj.stageName)) { %]
- `[%= stageObj.stageName %]`: deploy with `./scripts/deploy.sh [%= stageObj.stageSlug() %]`
[% } %]

## Preconditions

- AWS SAM CLI is installed.
- AWS credentials are configured for the target stage.
- Manual actions with `BLOCKER` severity are resolved.

